{
  "summary": "Yes, the contract includes profit-sharing, requiring ISA to pay Rubicon 30% of its profits on projects where Rubicon provided Contract Services, after recouping start-up costs.",
  "evidence": [
    {
      "passage_id": 4,
      "quote": "In addition to the payments set forth in sections 4.2.1 and 4.2.2, above, ISA will pay Rubicon 30% of ISA's profits (defined as  gross revenues less costs directly incurred in the generation of such revenues) on projects for which Rubicon has provided Contract Services  after ISA has recouped any directly attributable start-up costs with respect to such project up to a cumulative maximum of £100,000 of such costs  associated with all such projects from the date of this agreement."
    }
  ]
}
